      "snippet": {
        "line": 350,
        "text": "def outputDifference (h) (P₀) (P Q : Profile) (i : Fin 4) (X η) := Q.outputs h P₀ X i η - P.outputs h P₀ X i η — the four components are Q_s, N_s, p_{s,1}, p_{s,2}, i.e. Δ(Q_s,N_s,p_s)"
